        <div class="ky-bit-chip" id="chip_y63"><div class="ky-bit-chip-label"><span class="ky-bit-chip-name text-info">Hava Isıtıcı</span><span class="ky-tag text-dark">Y63</span></div><div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><span class="ky-bit-status-text" id="bit_y63">…</span><span class="ky-bit-dot"></span></div></div>
